= Korwat of Bodhinana

The following describes the process of cleaning and placing the cushions and seats in the meditation hall, following the rules established by the monastic community. These are the disciplines observed in the Santacittarama monastery, and all community members are expected to follow them to maintain an atmosphere of respect.

